8dffe@theoriginals.com.ua","ж-08854@brenda.ua","ж-11759@theoriginals.com.ua"],["ж53-ee111fbb2c6fe3c81cd3@theoriginals.com.ua","ж-08854@brenda.ua","ж-11759@theoriginals.com.ua"]],"текст_моделі":"{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "You are ready for the rock concert in a look that balances the loud atmosphere with your requested classic style. The pencil skirt sits perfectly on your defined waist, while the blazer adds structure and a sleek silhouette. I chose this combination to give you an anchor that holds up even when standing in a crowd all night.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep the blazer unbuttoned to show off the classic line of the skirt without adding bulk."
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
  "swap": null,
  "named": [],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#205·09",
      "text": "This is a grey pencil skirt featuring a subtle check pattern. The cut is slim and sits at your waist, creating a clean vertical line that elongates your figure."
    },
    {
      "n": "#115·11",
      "text": "A structured black blazer with a single-breasted front. It has a tailored fit that provides a sharp, classic layer over the skirt."
    },
    {
      "n": "#266·35",
      "text": "A silvery ring designed to add a touch of metallic shine to your hand or finger."
    },
    {
      "n": "#86·10",
      "text": "These are sand-colored pumps with a high heel. They provide height and elongate the leg line under the skirt."
    },
    {
      "n": "#481·35",
      "text": "An orange generic bag that serves as a bold pop of color against your monochrome base layers."
    }
  ]
}"}

