  "version": "1",
  "text": "This look is perfect for your rock concert at the club. I chose a fitted black top to keep your silhouette clean, and I paired it with a beige pencil skirt that will hold its shape even as you stand in the crowd. The long quilted coat adds warmth and structure for an evening in autumn, while the white bag brings a sharp contrast against the darker layers. Gold jewelry picks up the stage lights, and black pumps ground the whole outfit so you can dance comfortably.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the fitted top under the belt of your pencil skirt to highlight your waist without adding bulk.",
    "Wear the long quilted coat open when you arrive to show off the classic silhouette, then button it up once the venue gets cold.",
    "Carry the white bag on your arm so its color pops against the black and beige tones of your ensemble."
  ],
